  "precommitted_interpretation_checks": [
    "GAAP net revenues rise 284 USD million sequentially, not 27%; the 27% Q3 headline compares Q3 with prior-year Q3. The five selected revenue components reconcile exactly: net interest +228, asset fees +103, trading +43, bank account fees 0 and other -90.",
    "Expenses excluding interest rise 66, so pretax income rises 218; taxes fall 14, so GAAP net income rises 232 USD million. Do not call the full net-income change a revenue-only effect.",
    "Preferred stock dividends and other fall from 149 to 81, contributing an additional 68 to the +300 USD million increase in net income available to common stockholders. Do not conflate firmwide net income with common-available income.",
    "Adjusted non-GAAP net income rises 234, from 2222 to 2456 USD million, and is distinct from GAAP net income 2126 to 2358. Diluted shares decline by 11 million and EPS rises 0.18 USD/share.",
    "These accounting bridges do not prove causal durability, valuation, or a trade."
